{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "%@失敗（錯誤代碼 %@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ failed (error %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（自動）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (Auto)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 顯示卡：%@；whisper：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Graphics: %1$@; whisper: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key 存在 Windows 的認證管理員，不會寫進任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are stored in Windows Credential Manager and never written to any file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速下載好了，重新開啟拾音後，轉錄就會用顯示卡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration is ready. Reopen Shiyin to transcribe on the GPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速（CUDA）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration (CUDA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NVIDIA 顯示卡加速：轉錄會快很多，685 MB（解開約 1.1 GB）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NVIDIA GPU acceleration: much faster transcription, 685 MB (about 1.1 GB unpacked)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PDF 和 docx 的段落標題使用明體；Markdown 適合貼到 Notion、GitHub。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PDF and docx use a serif font for section headings; Markdown is good for pasting into Notion or GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WAV 缺少格式區段": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The WAV file has no format chunk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows 解不開 .%@ 的檔案：請先轉成 m4a、mp3 或 wav 再匯入（ogg、opus 可以從 Microsoft Store 安裝「Web 媒體延伸模組」）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windows can’t decode .%@ files. Convert it to m4a, mp3, or wav and import again (for ogg and opus, install “Web Media Extensions” from the Microsoft Store)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "claude 沒有回傳結果（結束代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude returned no result (exit code %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "codex 沒有回傳結果（結束代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex returned no result (exit code %lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「待確認」列出整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限。在「你的回答」欄位直接回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的勾「略過」。也可以在「摘要」按「編輯」直接改。改錯了可以從「更多」選「復原上一版會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“To confirm” lists names, terms, owners and deadlines the summarizer wasn't sure about. Type in “Your answer” and click “Submit”, and the notes are revised from your answers; check “Skip” for anything unclear or unimportant. You can also click “Edit” in “Summary” to change things directly. To undo a mistake, choose “Revert to previous notes” from “More”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・匯入：把錄音檔拖進視窗，或按「匯入」（Ctrl+O）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Import: drag a recording into the window, or click Import (Ctrl+O)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・拾音會常駐在工作列右下角的系統匣，關掉視窗也會繼續錄音和整理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Shiyin stays in the system tray at the bottom right of the taskbar; closing the window keeps recording and processing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・錄音：側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R），或在其他 app 裡按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Record: click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R), or press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R in any app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載的壓縮檔裡少了需要的檔案，請重新下載": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The downloaded archive is missing required files. Please download it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下載的檔案不完整": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The download is incomplete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支援 %lld 位元": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld-bit audio is not supported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支援的 WAV 格式 %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported WAV format %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後隨時可以從系統匣或設定的「進階」再打開使用說明。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can open this guide again any time from the system tray or Settings → Advanced."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介面": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interface"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "介面語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interface language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依回答修正": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revising with your answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止錄音並開始轉錄（Ctrl+R）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop recording and start transcribing (Ctrl+R)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全域快捷鍵 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R：在其他 app 裡也能開始或停止錄音": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global shortcut Ctrl+Alt+Shift+R: start or stop recording from any app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到逐字稿改名": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rename in Transcript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匯入錄音、影片、逐字稿或 .shiyin 封包（Ctrl+O）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import a recording, video, transcript or .shiyin package (Ctrl+O)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匯出 PDF 失敗": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't export the PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匯出 PDF 需要 Microsoft Edge WebView2 執行階段，這台電腦沒有安裝。可以到微軟的網站下載安裝（免費），或先匯出成 Word。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporting PDF needs the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, which isn't installed on this PC. You can download it free from Microsoft, or export to Word instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即時逐字稿和快速辨識用，約 240 MB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for the live transcript and Quick recognition, about 240 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完整的授權條款": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full License Terms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已儲存在認證管理員": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved in Credential Manager"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已儲存在認證管理員（輸入新的會取代）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved in Credential Manager (type a new one to replace it)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "從「更多」選「匯出…」（Ctrl+E）：會議紀錄可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；錄音可以存成 m4a、wav；「整場會議（.shiyin）」可以傳給同事，對方雙擊就能匯入（Mac 版也可以）。「複製會議紀錄」可以直接貼到 Notion、Slack 或郵件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose More → Export… (Ctrl+E): notes can be saved as Markdown, PDF or Word; transcripts as txt, srt, vtt or Word; recordings as m4a or wav. Send a “Whole meeting (.shiyin)” to a colleague and they can import it with a double-click (on the Mac version too). “Copy meeting notes” pastes straight into Notion, Slack or email."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "從對話內容猜到 %lld 位說話者的名字": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Guessed the name of %lld speaker from the conversation"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Guessed the names of %lld speakers from the conversation"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快捷鍵沒有回應": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shortcut didn't respond"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快速辨識": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quick recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快速辨識模型 SenseVoice": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quick recognition model SenseVoice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快速辨識模型 SenseVoice：即時逐字稿，約 240 MB": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quick recognition model SenseVoice: live transcript, about 240 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快速辨識的模型還在下載": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The quick recognition model is still downloading"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打開設定": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到 %@ 指令": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't find the %@ command"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到授權條款的檔案，請重新安裝拾音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The license file is missing. Please reinstall Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音幫你把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄：錄音時就能看到即時逐字稿，錄完會在這台電腦上正式轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper）、分辨說話者，再用 Claude、Codex 或 API 整理成摘要、決議和待辦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes: you see a live transcript while recording, then it transcribes on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper for Japanese), tells speakers apart, and uses Claude, Codex or an API to write a summary, decisions and action items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音把會議變成逐字稿和會議紀錄。錄音、轉錄、說話者辨識都在這台電腦上完成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin turns meetings into transcripts and meeting notes. Recording, transcription and speaker recognition all happen on this PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音是 MIT 授權的開源軟體，用到下列軟體和模型：": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin is open-source software under the MIT License. It uses the following software and models:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音會議封包": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin meeting package"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音沒有麥克風的使用權限": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin doesn't have permission to use the microphone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：處理中": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: working"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：錄音中 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: recording %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：錄音中 %@，%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: recording %@, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台電腦上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，日文用 Whisper large-v3-turbo），並分辨不同的說話者。等待的時候，會議紀錄會先用即時逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了會自動換掉。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改；拾音會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入名字（標「自動」，認錯了點一下就能改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you click Stop and transcribe, Shiyin transcribes again on this PC (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for Japanese) and tells the speakers apart. While you wait, a draft of the notes is written from the live transcript and replaced automatically when the final version is ready. Click “Speaker 1” in the transcript to give a real name and the whole meeting updates; Shiyin remembers that voice and fills in the name in later meetings (marked Auto — click it if it's wrong)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「開始使用」後就可以錄音或匯入了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Get started, then record or import."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按側欄上方的「錄音」（Ctrl+R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（Ctrl+O），或在檔案總管按右鍵用拾音開啟都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Record at the top of the sidebar (Ctrl+R) to start. The arrow next to it chooses the source — for online meetings pick “Microphone + computer audio (online meeting)” so the other side is recorded too. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click Import (Ctrl+O), or right-click it in File Explorer and open it with Shiyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "播放": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到這台電腦上的服務（%@），不會離開電腦。錄音檔不會送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes, answering questions and guessing speakers, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting info are sent to a service on this PC (%@) and never leave it. Recordings are never sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暫停錄音（Ctrl+Shift+P）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause recording (Ctrl+Shift+P)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新金鑰不符": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the update key doesn't match"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "替說話者取名時，拾音會記下這個人的聲音特徵。之後的會議認出同一個人，就自動帶入名字並標「自動」，不對可以改。聲音特徵只存在這台電腦的資料庫，不會上傳，也不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you name a speaker, Shiyin saves that person's voice features. When it recognizes the same person in a later meeting, it fills in the name and marks it Auto; you can change it if it's wrong. Voice features stay in the database on this PC — never uploaded and never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議可以分資料夾：在會議上按右鍵（或「更多」）選「移到資料夾」→「新資料夾…」。正在看某個資料夾時，新錄的和匯入的會議都會放進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings can go in folders: right-click a meeting (or use More) and choose Move to folder → New folder…. While you're viewing a folder, new recordings and imports go into it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "會議日期：依各檔案的檔名或修改日期": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting date: from each file's name or modification date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 NVIDIA 顯示卡時自動下載，轉錄會快很多。685 MB，解開約 1.1 GB（whisper.cpp 官方的 CUDA 版）。刪除後不會再自動下載。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded automatically when an NVIDIA GPU is present; transcription is much faster. 685 MB, about 1.1 GB unpacked (the official CUDA build of whisper.cpp). Once deleted, it won't be downloaded automatically again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "標記這個時間點（Ctrl+B），整理時會被當成重點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark this moment (Ctrl+B); it's treated as a highlight when writing notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型只需要下載一次，之後轉錄都不需要網路。可以先按「下一步」，在背景繼續下載；快速辨識的模型下載好就能錄音，正式轉錄的模型下載好之前先用快速辨識。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Models only need to be downloaded once; transcription works offline after that. You can click Next and let them download in the background. Once the quick recognition model is ready you can record, and Quick recognition is used until the transcription model is ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在下載%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
