    "目前不整理：錄音、轉錄、逐字稿全部留在這台電腦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are off: recordings, transcription and transcripts all stay on this PC."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "繼續錄音（Ctrl+Shift+P）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resume recording (Ctrl+Shift+P)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聲紋（說話者的聲音特徵，一組數字，不是錄音）只存在這台電腦，不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voiceprints (a speaker's voice features: a list of numbers, not audio) stay on this PC and are never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要先安裝並登入對應的 CLI。登入後可以在「設定 → 整理工具」按「測試整理工具」確認。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install and sign in to the CLI first. Then click Test in Settings → Notes engine to check it works."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "覺得拾音好用的話，可以請我喝杯咖啡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enjoying Shiyin? Buy me a coffee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分得太少（人多、吵雜、手機放在桌上遠距收音）時，從「更多」選「重新辨識說話者…」，告訴拾音大約幾個人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If too few speakers were found (many people, noise, a phone on the table), choose More → Re-identify speakers… and tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者分錯了：同一個人被分成兩位，點說話者的名字選「合併到…」；某幾句分錯人，在逐字稿按右鍵選「這句是誰說的」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If speakers are wrong: when one person was split into two, click the speaker's name and choose Merge into…; when a few lines have the wrong speaker, right-click them in the transcript and choose Who said this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識模型：分辨是誰在說話，約 46 MB": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speaker recognition model: tells who is speaking, about 46 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識用，約 46 MB。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for speaker recognition, about 46 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "說話者辨識的模型還在下載，下載好後再試一次": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The speaker recognition model is still downloading. Try again when it's ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "請到「設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 麥克風」打開「麥克風存取」和「讓傳統型應用程式存取您的麥克風」，再重新開始錄音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to Settings → Privacy & security → Microphone, turn on “Microphone access” and “Let desktop apps access your microphone”, then start recording again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀不到認證管理員裡的 key（錯誤代碼 %lld）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
