        }
      }
    },
    "跟著 Windows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same as Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成、會議紀錄整理好時通知你。已允許。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifies you when transcription and meeting notes are done. Allowed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成、會議紀錄整理好時通知你。通知被關掉時，可以在 Windows 的「系統 → 通知」打開。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifies you when transcription and meeting notes are done. If notifications are off, turn them on in Windows Settings → System → Notifications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完成後把錄音壓縮成 m4a（約每小時 43 MB）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compress recordings to m4a after transcription (about 43 MB per hour)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄完會自動整理。「摘要」有重點、決議、待辦和未決問題；「詳細」依議題分段；每一條後面的時間點點一下，就從錄音那裡開始播放。範本選單可以換成一對一、訪談、課堂／演講、腦力激盪等格式，換完從「更多」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。想找某件事，可以在「提問」分頁直接問，回答會附上時間點；側欄上方的提問按鈕可以一次問所有會議。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes are written automatically after transcription. Summary has key points, decisions, action items and open questions; Details is split by topic; click the time after any item to play the recording from there. The template menu switches to formats like one-on-one, interview, lecture or brainstorm — then choose More → Regenerate meeting notes. To find something, ask in the Ask tab and the answer comes with timestamps; the Ask button at the top of the sidebar asks all meetings at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄正在用這個元件，重新開啟拾音後才能刪除": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription is using this component. Reopen Shiyin to delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄（快速辨識）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribing (quick recognition)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
