    },
    "這台電腦找不到 claude。沒有在用 Claude Code 的話，請到設定 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Claude Code, go to Settings → Summarizer and choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦找不到 codex。沒有在用 Codex 的話，請到設定 → 整理工具改用 API（填 API key）或選「不整理」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Codex, go to Settings → Summarizer and choose an API (with an API key) or “Don't summarize”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有 Claude Code 或 Codex。要用 AI 整理會議紀錄，選一個 API 並貼上 API key（有取得 key 的連結）；也可以之後再設定，錄音和逐字稿照常能用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This PC doesn't have Claude Code or Codex. To have AI write your meeting notes, choose an API and paste an API key (there's a link to get one). You can also set this up later; recording and transcripts work either way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有安裝 claude：沒有在用 Claude Code 的話，請改選 API": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "claude isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Claude Code, choose an API instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台電腦沒有安裝 codex：沒有在用 Codex 的話，請改選 API": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex isn't installed on this PC. If you don't use Codex, choose an API instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這場會議是在模型下載好之前，用快速辨識轉錄的。可以用 Breeze 重新轉錄，通常比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting was transcribed with Quick recognition before the model finished downloading. Re-transcribing with Breeze is usually more accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這場會議是在模型下載好之前，用快速辨識轉錄的。可以用日文轉錄模型重新轉錄，通常比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting was transcribed with Quick recognition before the model finished downloading. Re-transcribing with the Japanese model is usually more accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這組快捷鍵已經被別的 app 用了": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another app is already using this shortcut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "速度快很多，下載也小；但不參考詞彙表，英文專有名詞、人名比較容易錯。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Much faster with a small download, but it ignores the glossary, so English terms and names are more often wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連線逾時": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection timed out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "遇到問題，可以從設定的「進階」選「回報問題…」，會附上版本和環境（不含會議內容）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If something goes wrong, choose Report a problem… in Settings → Advanced; it includes the version and environment (no meeting content)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒設定整理工具：錄音、轉錄、逐字稿全部留在這台電腦。選好整理工具之後，才會整理成會議紀錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No summarizer is set up yet: recordings, transcription and transcripts all stay on this PC. Meeting notes are created once you choose a summarizer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新打開拾音後換成新的介面語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new interface language takes effect after you reopen Shiyin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄現場會議或你自己的聲音。Windows 的「隱私權與安全性 → 麥克風」要允許桌面 app 使用麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records in-person meetings or your own voice. In Windows Settings → Privacy & security → Microphone, desktop apps must be allowed to use the microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」：你的聲音和對方的聲音會分別錄在左右聲道。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For online meetings choose “Microphone + computer audio”: your voice and the other side are recorded on the left and right channels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄線上會議（Zoom、Meet、Teams）對方的聲音。Windows 不用另外允許，錄音時選「麥克風＋電腦聲音」就好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the other side of online meetings (Zoom, Meet, Teams). Windows needs no extra permission — just choose “Microphone + computer audio” when recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音、逐字稿和會議紀錄都只存在這台電腦上（%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin），不會跟著帳號漫遊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings, transcripts and meeting notes are stored only on this PC (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Shiyin) and don't roam with your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B 標記重點（在其他 app 裡也能用）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B to mark a highlight (works in any app)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音中畫面左邊是即時逐字稿，講完幾秒內就會出現；右邊「我的筆記」每換一行會自動記下當時的錄音時間。重要的地方按「標記重點」（Ctrl+B），在其他 app 裡也可以按 Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B。需要中斷時按「暫停」（Ctrl+Shift+P），暫停的時間不會錄進去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While recording, the live transcript is on the left and appears a few seconds after each sentence; each new line in My notes on the right gets the recording time. Click Mark highlight (Ctrl+B) for important moments, or press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+B in any app. Click Pause (Ctrl+Shift+P) to stop for a while; paused time isn't recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音和轉錄都只在這台電腦上進行，不會上傳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording and transcription happen only on this PC and are never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開 Zoom、Teams、Google Meet 等線上會議時，拾音會提醒你開始錄音；會議好像結束時提醒停止。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an online meeting starts in Zoom, Teams, Google Meet and so on, Shiyin reminds you to record, and reminds you to stop when it seems to have ended."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開始錄音（Ctrl+R），用%@辨識；點右邊的箭頭可以改錄音來源和語言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording (Ctrl+R), recognizing %@; click the arrow on the right to change the source and language"
          }
        }
      }
